Package: complyverse-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pip, python3-cryptography, python3-paramiko
Maintainer: Compliverse <support@compliverse.app>
Description: Compliverse compliance agent
 Pulls CIS benchmark check jobs from Compliverse cloud and executes
 them locally (Linux endpoint mode) or against remote network devices
 via SSH (collector mode). Sends results back as immutable evidence.
 .
 Configuration after install:
   sudo /opt/complyverse-agent/bin/complyverse-agent enroll \
        --backend https://your-tenant.compliverse.app \
        --token enroll_xxxxxxxxx
   sudo systemctl enable --now complyverse-agent
Homepage: https://compliverse.app
